Method	Time	Space
get(index)	O(n)	O(1)
addAtHead(val)	O(1)	O(1)
addAtTail(val)	O(n)	O(1)
addAtIndex(index,val)	O(n)	O(1)
deleteAtIndex(index)	O(n)	O(1)


